        "person-yi-chia-chen-roster-0"
      ],
      "text": "Yi-Chia Chen raised her public ARC-AGI-3 score from 59.17 to 62.96 in a recorded event and stayed first. Tufa Labs holds second at 56.52. The event confirms Chen’s higher mark; the brief does not establish a net gain from the midnight baseline for her entry. Her verified Kaggle account, threerabbits, is also listed on a separate ARC-AGI-2 team."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The chasing group stays packed",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-jean-francois-puget-roster-1",
        "person-ivan-sorokin-roster-0",
        "person-jean-francois-puget-archive-0",
        "person-ivan-sorokin-archive-0"
      ],
      "text": "Behind the leading pair, mtg is third at 44.32, Majkel1337 fourth at 42.66 and NVARC3 fifth at 40.97. The last dance follows at 39.30, ahead of dreach.ai, Nhan Duc Nguyen, artificialagencylab.com and 復活の混テキスト. Those top-ten places did not change against the available midnight comparison. Jean-François Puget and Ivan Sorokin are listed on NVARC3’s 2026 roster; both are credited on the 2025 NVARC championship record. That earlier result belongs to the earlier team and season."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Movement below the leaders",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Akagha Chimgozirim reached 33.29 and 44th, a gain of 2.37 points and 161 places against the available baseline. The event log also records AibePC reaching 33.02 and 59th. Lord Han Solo remains 13th at 36.61; David Hartmann and Jan Disselhoff sit farther back. The public medal bands are provisional, and later submission evaluations may change this morning’s order."
    }
